# Hey Claude: household knowledge

Notes the voice assistant reads at the start of every session. Keep it short. Claude adds to it when it learns something.
Device instructions load on their own from `devices/*/device.md`, so they don't belong here.

## Learnings
- (Claude writes things it figures out here.)

## Devices and rooms
- (Which room each TV, speaker and Echo is in.)

## Device nicknames
- (Example: "the lamp" = the floor lamp in the living room.)

## Netflix title ids (for `roku.sh netflix <id>`)
- (Example: Black Mirror 70264888)

## User preferences
- (Language, how short replies should be, who lives here.)
